# Quran translations must never be committed. Tanzil's translations carry
# non-commercial-only terms, so redistributing one — including as a test
# fixture — would conflict with this project's GPL-3.0 and with the
# "no non-open component" bar for code signing. tests/translations.test.js
# runs against a synthetic file and skips its real-file case when absent;
# drop a downloaded copy here locally if you want that case to run.
tests/fixtures/*.txt
